    # "She lurched towards one of the rooms where she slammed the door behind her."
    "她踉跄地冲进一个房间，砰地关上了门。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DaughterOfMetal/scr_02.rpy:217
translate zh qst_DaughterOfMetal_02_2_8800a557_1:

    # "It was quickly followed by the sounds of retching."
